<title>USA: Tekelec sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Tekelec sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CALABASAS, Calif. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tekelec Monday said its board of directors has approved a two-for-one stock split of it's common stock.</p>
<p>The additional shares will be distributed on August 22 to shareholders of record on August 8. Tekelec has about 12.6 million common shares outstanding.</p>
